WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.174
The checkpoint now tests practical classification and lookup.

2
00:00:04.174 --> 00:00:08.075
First separate the family or code base from a named core.

3
00:00:08.075 --> 00:00:13.686
Then decode CV32E20 without turning the part number into a complete specification.

4
00:00:13.686 --> 00:00:18.134
Identify CORE-V-XIF as the defining integration path of CV32E40X.

5
00:00:18.134 --> 00:00:23.950
Finally select the three identity CSRs that belong in a release-level hardware check.

